<div id="S1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The precise statement and parameter choices appear in
<a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 4.3 (Sampler from an order-2 Rényi warm start). ‣ Choice of parameters. ‣ 4.3 Implementable Proximal BPS and total complexity ‣ 4 Efficient implementation of Proximal BPS ‣ Accelerated High-Accuracy Sampling from a Warm Startvia the Proximal Bouncy Particle Sampler" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorems</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a> and <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem4" title="Corollary 4.4 (Optimized gradient complexity). ‣ Choice of parameters. ‣ 4.3 Implementable Proximal BPS and total complexity ‣ 4 Efficient implementation of Proximal BPS ‣ Accelerated High-Accuracy Sampling from a Warm Startvia the Proximal Bouncy Particle Sampler" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.4</span></a>.</p>
